        "jsCode": "const criticalityMap = { low: 2, medium: 3, high: 4, critical: 5 };\n\nconst level = $json.criticality_override_level;\nconst score = criticalityMap[level];\n\nif (!score) throw new Error(`Nivel no reconocido: ${level}`);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    asset_id: $json.asset_id,\n    criticality_override_level: level,\n    criticality_score: score,\n    criticality_norm: score / 5,\n    criticality_overridden: true,\n    override_justification: $json.justification,\n    override_timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
